---

Trace the affected command from `jobs/cli.py` into the pure modules and remote adapter.
Change transformations and model-facing columns together. Add tests for the actual
leakage risk and prediction contract, then run `make test lint security docs-build`.
Use `make demo` for a local end-to-end check. Update the appropriate docs page.
For bundle changes, run the offline schema check and, when remote access is authorized,
`make bundle-validate PROFILE=<chosen> TARGET=dev`. Run `make integration-dev` only
against an explicitly selected, isolated DEV namespace after deployment.
